docs {
  # PeopleService.ImportRoll

  Loads the real roll from a spreadsheet (phase E9): commit=false checks every row and reconciles the totals per section; commit=true imports, and only when the check has no errors

  `/ltedu.people.v1.PeopleService/ImportRoll` · unary · `ltedu/people/v1/people.proto`

  ## Request — `ImportRollRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `period_id` | `string` |  |
  | `rows` | `repeated ImportRow` |  |
  | `commit` | `bool` |  |

  ## Response — `ImportRollResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `rows` | `repeated ImportResult` |  |
  | `sections` | `repeated ImportSection` |  |
  | `total` | `int32` |  |
  | `ready` | `int32` |  |
  | `skipped` | `int32` |  |
  | `errors` | `int32` |  |
  | `created` | `int32` |  |
  | `enrolled` | `int32` |  |
  | `committed` | `bool` |  |
  | `period_before` | `int32` |  |
  | `period_after` | `int32` |  |

  ## Tipos

  ### `ImportRow`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
