  | `birth_date` | `string` | dd/mm/aaaa |
  | `sex` | `string` | M (mujer) \| H (hombre) |
  | `email` | `string` |  |
  | `phone` | `string` |  |
  | `cycle` | `string` |  |
  | `grade` | `string` |  |
  | `section` | `string` |  |
  | `kind` | `string` | nuevo \| promovido \| trasladado \| reentrante |
  | `origin` | `string` |  |

  ### `ImportResult`

  status: ready \| existing (the student is already in the institution) \| skipped (already enrolled) \| enrolled \| error

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
